/features/projects/project-shell-page.ts:83-101, apps/platform/client/features/processes/process-materials-section.ts:48-70, apps/platform/client/features/processes/process-work-surface-page.ts:214-228). Bootstrap now calls the real POST routes through browser API wrappers and immediately refetches the active shell/surface after create (apps/platform/client/browser-api/projects-api.ts:108-127, apps/platform/client/browser-api/process-work-surface-api.ts:233-256, apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1636-1709). Client tests cover the project-shell and process-surface attach submissions (tests/service/client/project-shell-page.test.ts:125-180, tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts:559-602).\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/01-attach-repositories-to-a-project-or-process/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:451:        rationale: \"Process currentSources now carry repositoryFullName and attachmentScope in the shared contract (apps/platform/shared/contracts/process-work-surface.ts:319-333), the materials reader projects both fields from durable source attachments (apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts:80-101), and the process materials UI renders Repository and Scope details for each current source (apps/platform/client/features/processes/process-materials-section.ts:236-253). The refreshed process attach API expectation now requires both fields after create (tests/service/server/source-management-api.test.ts:222-236), and client rendering tests assert that the process surface shows repository identity and scope (tests/service/client/process-materials-section.test.ts:45-57, tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts:537-557).\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/01-attach-repositories-to-a-project-or-process/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-005.md:486:      - \"The regression evide